@CosmosCustomerApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5228

### Get all customers
GET {{CosmosCustomerApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a specific customer
GET {{CosmosCustomerApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers/your-customer-id
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new customer
POST {{CosmosCustomerApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+1-555-0123",
  "address": {
    "street": "123 Main St",
    "city": "Seattle",
    "state": "WA",
    "postalCode": "98101",
    "country": "USA"
  },
  "dateOfBirth": "1985-06-15T00:00:00Z",
  "isActive": true,
  "loyaltyPoints": 100,
  "totalOrderValue": 500.00
}

###

### Update a customer
PUT {{CosmosCustomerApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers/your-customer-id
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "your-customer-id",
  "customerId": "your-customer-id",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.updated@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+1-555-0124",
  "address": {
    "street": "456 Oak Ave",
    "city": "Seattle",
    "state": "WA",
    "postalCode": "98102",
    "country": "USA"
  },
  "dateOfBirth": "1985-06-15T00:00:00Z",
  "isActive": true,
  "loyaltyPoints": 250,
  "totalOrderValue": 1500.00
}

###

### Delete a customer
DELETE {{CosmosCustomerApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers/your-customer-id

###
